  "title": "NCR Atleos announces date of second quarter 2026 earnings results",
  "summary": "NCR Atleos Corporation (NYSE: NATL) (“Atleos”) will release second quarter 2026 financial results before the market opens on Wednesday, August 5, 2026.Due to the pending transaction with The Brinks Company, NCR Atleos will not be hosting an earnings conference call to review the second quarter or issue a financial outlook.",
